    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH) commenced its Clifton Medical Services on January 1, 2004, as part of its objective of providing accessible, compassionate and high quality health care to patients and their families. Located at Clifton behind Indus Valley School of Art and Architecture in Karachi, the facility is part of the Hospital's outreach programme which aims to provide easy and convenient access to patients residing in distant areas of the city. The opening of Clifton Medical Services is a testament to AKU's rapid growth and its aim of providing the best possible options for diagnosis of disease and team management of patient care comparable to the best medical centres.",
